      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;project-objective&#34;&gt;Project Objective&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A navigation system that can search for and navigate to any object specified - as an image, language, or a category - in completely unseen environments, without requiring pre-computed maps or locations of objects, while exploiting the semantics information of the environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
